<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>higher. Trading moderately active. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   56.50-57.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   56.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs firm to 0.25 higher; 450-650 lbs steady. Top</p>
<p>49.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.75-46.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
